Package: michka-agent
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Michka <michka@localhost>
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, adduser
Description: Michka monitor agent (Linux client)
 Collects this machine's CPU / memory / network / disk / temperature metrics and pushes them to a
 Michka hub on an interval. No web server. Self-contained (the .NET runtime is bundled).
 .
 Set the hub URL in /etc/default/michka-agent (MICHKA_ARGS) and start the michka-agent service.
 The host then appears as its own tab on the hub's dashboard.
